    "updated_at": "2022-12-01T15:49:03Z",
    "body": "So `span` is also not in the list, and therefore this would not satisfy the requirement:\r\n\r\n```html\r\n<p><span>text</span></p>\r\n```\r\n\r\nThat seems wrong. I don't think the fix is to add `span` to the list, but rather to say that there should be a palpable content *descendant* instead of child.\r\n\r\nThat would make `picture` be allowed since it's required to contain an `img`.\r\n\r\nIt would also make the `del` example allowed, since the grandchild is text, but if `ins` is palpable I don't see why `del` shouldn't also be.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
